  "description": "This package implements file streams which can be used to extract or encode Opus packets in an Ogg-formatted audio file (usually .opus), giving developers a very simple API to perform the task of reading or writing audio files that can be played universally. The Concentus library is used to encode/decode the opus packets automatically. The codec can optionally be accelerated by also referencing the Concentus.Native package.",
